# Why this Module ships no seed/ directory.
# A marker with no justification is a silent skip in file form; lint-config
# refuses an empty one.

Flower stores its own state in the flower-data volume (--persistent=True,
--db=/data/flower.db) and rebuilds everything else from the Celery broker. There
is nothing to load at first boot: with no worker connected it shows an empty
cluster, which is the correct empty state rather than missing data.
